> and does being unable to teleport away and take a break have an
> effect on that?

It's a flat chance, so no.

How much she's improved your max HP by in that time (that is, how many
of those hits incremented it) will depend on what your max HP was to
start with and what level you are; there's a 1/7 chance per healing
hit that she will attempt to do so, but the chance of her succeeding
is according to the following formula:

      if (u.uhpmax < 5 * u.ulevel + d(2 * u.ulevel, 10))
           u.uhpmax++;

